# Clojure / JVM
target/
.cpcache/
.nrepl-port
*.class

# JVM fatal-error crash dumps. Every windowed exercise/test in this course
# opens a real GLFW window by design, so running one without an available
# display (CI, headless box, locked screen) hard-crashes the JVM and drops
# these in the repo root. Regenerated noise, never source.
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log

